<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong January merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong January merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 Jan 1997	   Dec 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 36.59 (- 1.8)    38.81 (+ 9.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				  19.65 (+11.5)    18.27 (+ 9.9)</p>
<p> Japan				  7.15 (+ 3.6)     5.91 (- 5.6)</p>
<p> Germany				4.06 (- 8.6)     3.69 (-15.4)</p>
<p> U.K.				   2.83 (+ 1.0)     2.83 (+ 3.8)</p>
</text>
